                                "sense_id": "9cf69b1c-3b24-3825-bc22-0cfa4b89d4fc",
                                "text": "The claims of the universal monological subject often become obsessed with homogeneity, purity, and unity at the expense of those others who do not fit the master narrative of monological reason."
