                            {
                                "example_id": "a97a752d-26d2-4a97-ac93-4f29f5f06083",
                                "sense_id": "9cf69b1c-3b24-3825-bc22-0cfa4b89d4fc",
                                "text": "A monological ethos can be conceived as an absence of communication, embodied within the media by its inability to directly challenge governmental policies […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "796e9f84-a776-4899-b99b-c223f7467806",
                                "sense_id": "9cf69b1c-3b24-3825-bc22-0cfa4b89d4fc",
                                "text": "On the self-expression of an autonomous subject or the Ich, is dialectic, which is utterly monological. And yet, the monological discourse is the one wherein everything is in nuce already finalized in its very intention […]"
